  "description": "Table MA had 256 rows over many pages, all deleted. For a table-type recordset without Index, one with Index PK_MA, a dynaset, a snapshot and a forward-only recordset in turn: open MA, read BOF, EOF and RecordCount, then call MoveFirst, MoveLast, MoveNext and MovePrevious reading BOF, EOF and Fields(\"ID\").Value after each. Asks whether a table whose pages hold only deleted rows reports empty in every type. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
